{"id":4626,"date":"2024-12-02T22:30:58","date_gmt":"2024-12-02T14:30:58","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=4626"},"modified":"2024-12-02T22:30:58","modified_gmt":"2024-12-02T14:30:58","slug":"stainless-steel-cartridge","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=stainless-steel-cartridge","title":{"rendered":"Stainless steel cartridge"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Stainless steel cartridge mainly adopts stainless steel sintered fiber felt and stainless steel woven mesh, processed by folding wave technology. Stainless steel sintered cartridge can be made of multi-layer structure, has high porosity, high dirty holding capacity.<br \/>\n<strong>Outside Dia.<\/strong>: 30~180mm<br \/>\n<strong>Length<\/strong>: 100~1200mm<br \/>\n<strong>Pleat Ht<\/strong>: 5~25mm<br \/>\n<strong>Filter rating<\/strong>: 0.5~150\u03bcm<br \/>\n<strong>Connector<\/strong>: Thread flange or ring sealing<br \/>\n<strong>Filter medium<\/strong>: 2-layered, 3-layered or more wire mesh composites<br \/>\n<strong>Inner support<\/strong>: perforated plate or spiral tube inner support<\/p>\n<h3>Features of\u00a0stainless steel cartridge\uff1a<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Stable dimensions.The ability to withstand alternative forces and shock resistance is superior to other metal filtration media;<\/li>\n<li>Stable filtration efficiency and permeability;<\/li>\n<li>Superior mechanical strength, and suitable to be used in high temperature, high pressure and strong corrosive applications; especially suitable to high temperature gas filtration;<\/li>\n<li>\u00a0Shapes and precision can be customized according your requirements, connectors can be welded onto tubes;<\/li>\n<li>\u00a0Good filtering performance;<\/li>\n<li>Good corrosion resistance, heat resistance, pressure resistance, wear resistance;<\/li>\n<li>Stainless steel filter pore uniform, accurate filtering precision; flow rate per unit area is large;<\/li>\n<li>Suitable for low temperature, high-temperature environment; can be reused after cleaning.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Specification of\u00a0stainless steel cartridge\u00a0\uff1a<\/h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Grade<\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Outer dia.(mm)<\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Length(mm)<\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Connection thread<\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Tail thread<\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Filtration area(m\u00b2)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-60A<\/td>\n<td>60<\/td>\n<td>1239<\/td>\n<td>M42*2<\/td>\n<td>M8<\/td>\n<td>0.86-1.00<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-60B<\/td>\n<td>60<\/td>\n<td>1215<\/td>\n<td>M42*2<\/td>\n<td>M8<\/td>\n<td>0.84-0.97<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-60C<\/td>\n<td>60<\/td>\n<td>900<\/td>\n<td>M36*3<\/td>\n<td>M8<\/td>\n<td>0.63-0.68<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-35A<\/td>\n<td>35<\/td>\n<td>425<\/td>\n<td>3\/4\u2019\u2019 16UNF or M20*1.5<\/td>\n<td>M5 or M6<\/td>\n<td>0.17-0.20<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-35B<\/td>\n<td>35<\/td>\n<td>485<\/td>\n<td>3\/4\u2019\u2019 16UNF or M20*1.5<\/td>\n<td>M5 or M6<\/td>\n<td>0.20-0.23<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-35C<\/td>\n<td>35<\/td>\n<td>525<\/td>\n<td>3\/4\u2019\u2019 16UNF or M20*1.5<\/td>\n<td>M5 or M6<\/td>\n<td>0.22-0.25<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Examples of main applications:<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Polymer filtration, petrochemical industry;<\/li>\n<li>Electronic high temperature gas dust removal;<\/li>\n<li>Machinery and equipment of various hydraulic oil, lubricating oil precision filtration;<\/li>\n<li>All kinds of liquid clarification filtration in medicine, biology, beverages indust<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4628\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/corrugated-candle-filter-detail1_syy-300x225.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"378\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/corrugated-candle-filter-detail1_syy-300x225.jpeg 300w, h